<title>SPAIN: Spain's Koipe 1996 net profit up 21.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Spain's Koipe 1996 net profit up 21.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full 1996 results for Koipe group in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Net profit				2.53     up   21.6 pct</p>
<p> Profit before tax		     3.30     up   29 pct</p>
<p> Turnover				100.58     down 11 pct</p>
<p> Net cash flow			   4.55     vs   n.a.</p>
<p> Net debt				  3.89     vs   18.52</p>
<p>NOTE: Koipe said olive oil consumption fell around 40 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>Exports of olive oil increased significantly, with sales abroad totalling 11.84 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Koipe said good forecasts for 1997's harvest led it to predict a recovery in consumption this year.</p>
<p>Koipe S.A. parent posted sales of 56.75 billion pesetas, with net profit of 1.22 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2340</p>
</text>
